    "text": "The ratio of kinetic energy at the mean position to potential energy at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> of a particle performing SHM is"
